	(text "BATTERY INPUT (J1): two solder pads for 8 AWG leads, pin 1 = BAT+ (VBUS, motor bus), pin 2 = BAT-. Sized for 60 A peak (2 x 30 A). Main fuse 80 A (ANL/MIDI) and an anti-spark pre-charge/contactor go in the battery lead OUTSIDE this board. F1 protects the logic branch (5 V buck + LDO, +24V aux buck), 10 A 58 V blade."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06c4f602-d3a7-453e-aae7-95ccc4a8cbbf")
	)
	(text "BOARD +5V BUCK U1 = TPS54360B (replaces LMR36520, 2026-10-24)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 375 35 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5e5b62f8-542a-5c9b-b542-a63b968dc1ae")
	)
	(text "Same design as U901 below: 494 kHz (R10 196k), 5.00 V = 0.8 V x (1 + R4 53.6k / R5 10.2k)."
